#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<p>"
"...that you can start new Konsole sessions by pressing the \"New\" button in "
"the Konsole toolbar?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>"
"...wat jy kan begin nuwe Konsole sessies deur gedruk die \"nuwe\" knoppie in "
"die Konsole nutsbalk?\n"

#: tips.cpp:7
msgid ""
"<p>...that pressing and holding the \"New\" button in the Konsole toolbar "
"will allow you to\n"
"select what session type the \"New\" button starts?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat gedruk en hou die \"Nuwe\" knoppie in die Konsole nutsbalk sal "
"toelaat jy na\n"
"kies wat sessie tipe die \"Nuwe\" knoppie beginne?\n"

#: tips.cpp:12
msgid ""
"<p>"
"...that pressing Ctrl+Alt+N is the same as clicking the \"New\" button in "
"the toolbar?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat gedruk Ctrl+Alt+n is die selfde as te kliek die \"Nuwe\" knoppie "
"in die nutsbalk?\n"

#: tips.cpp:16
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can cycle through the Konsole sessions by holding down the "
"Shift key and\n"
"pressing the Left or Right Arrow keys?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan wissel deur die Konsole sessies deur hou ondertoe die "
"Verskuiwende sleutel en\n"
"gedruk die Links of Regterkant Pyl sleutels?\n"

#: tips.cpp:21
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can get a 'Linux console-like' terminal? \n"
"<p>"
"Deactivate the Konsole's menubar, toolbar and scrollbar, select the Linux "
"font\n"
"and the Linux Colors schema and apply the full-screen mode. You might also "
"then\n"
"want to set the panel to auto-hide.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan kry 'n 'Linux console-like' terminaal? \n"
"<p>Deaktiveer die Konsole se kiesbalk, nutsbalk en rolstaaf, kies die Linux "
"skrif tipe\n"
"en die Linux Kleure skema en wend aan die vol-skerm modus. jy dalk asook dan "
"word\n"
"wil hê na stel die paneel na auto-hide.\n"

#: tips.cpp:28
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can rename your Konsole sessions by clicking with the right "
"mouse\n"
"button and selecting \"Rename session\"? The change will be reflected in "
"the\n"
"Konsole toolbar, making it easier to remember the content of the session.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan herbenaam jou Konsole sessies deur te kliek met die "
"regterkant muis\n"
"knoppie en deur te kies \"herbenaam sessie\"? die verander sal wees "
"reflekteer in die\n"
"Konsole nutsbalk, maak dit makliker na onthou die inhoud van die sessie.\n"

#: tips.cpp:34
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can rename a Konsole session by double-clicking its button\n"
"in the Konsole toolbar?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan herbenaam 'n Konsole sessie deur double-clicking sy "
"knoppie\n"
"in die Konsole nutsbalk?\n"

#: tips.cpp:39
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can activate the menu with the Ctrl+Alt+M shortcut?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan aktiveer die kieslys met die Ctrl+Alt+M kortpad?\n"

#: tips.cpp:43
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can rename your current Konsole session with the Ctrl+Alt+S "
"shortcut?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan herbenaam jou huidige Konsole sessie met die Ctrl+Alt+S "
"kortpad?\n"

#: tips.cpp:47
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can create your own session types by using the session\n"
"type editor which you can find under \"Settings/Configure Konsole...\"?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan skep jou eie sessie tipes deur te gebruik die sessie\n"
"tipe redigeerder wat jy kan soek onder \"Instellings/Konfigureer "
"Konsole...\"?\n"

#: tips.cpp:52
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can create your own color schemes by using the schema editor\n"
"which you can find under \"Settings/Configure Konsole...\"?\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan skep jou eie kleur skemas deur te gebruik die skema "
"redigeerder\n"
"wat jy kan soek onder \"Instellings/Konfigureer Konsole...\"?\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:58
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can reorder the session buttons in the toolbar with \"View\" "
"menu\n"
"commands or by holding down the Shift and Ctrl keys and pressing the Left or "
"Right \n"
"Arrow keys?\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan herrangskik die sessie knoppies in die nutsbalk met "
"\"Besigtig\" kieslys\n"
"opdragte of deur hou ondertoe die Verskuiwende en Ctrl sleutels en gedruk "
"die Links of Regterkant \n"
"Pyl sleutels?\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:65
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can scroll pagewise in the history by holding down the Shift "
"key \n"
"and pressing the Page Up or Page Down keys?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan rol bladsygewys in die geskiedenis deur hou ondertoe die "
"Verskuiwende sleutel \n"
"en gedruk die Bladsy Begin of Bladsy ondertoe sleutels?\n"

#: tips.cpp:70
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can scroll linewise in the history by holding down the Shift "
"key \n"
"and pressing the Up or Down Arrow keys?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan rol reelgewys in die geskiedenis deur hou ondertoe die "
"Verskuiwende sleutel \n"
"en gedruk die Begin of ondertoe Pyl sleutels?\n"

#: tips.cpp:75
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can insert the clipboard by holding down the Shift key and \n"
"pressing the Insert key?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan voeg deur die klipbord deur hou ondertoe die Verskuiwende "
"sleutel en \n"
"gedruk die voeg deur sleutel?\n"

#: tips.cpp:80
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can insert the X selection by holding down the Shift and\n"
"Ctrl keys and pressing the Insert key?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>"
"...wat jy kan voeg deur die X keuse deur hou ondertoe die Verskuiwende en \n"
"Ctrl sleutels en gedruk die voeg deur sleutel?\n"

#: tips.cpp:85
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can drag &amp; drop selected text?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan trek &amp; laat val gekose teks?\n"

#: tips.cpp:89
msgid ""
"<p>...that pressing Ctrl while pasting the selection with the middle mouse\n"
"button will append a carriage return after pasting the selection buffer?\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:94
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can turn off the terminal size hint under "
"\"Settings/Configure Konsole...\"?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan skakel af die terminaal grootte leidraad onder "
"\"Instellings/Konfigureer Konsole...\"?\n"

#: tips.cpp:98
msgid ""
"<p>...that pressing Ctrl while selecting text will let Konsole ignore line "
"breaks?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>"
"...wat gedruk Ctrl terwyl deur te kies teks sal laat Konsole ignoreer lyn "
"breke?\n"

#: tips.cpp:102
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that pressing the Ctrl and Alt keys while selecting text will let "
"Konsole select columns?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>"
"...wat gedruk Ctrl terwyl deur te kies teks sal laat Konsole ignoreer lyn "
"breke?\n"

#: tips.cpp:106
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that when a program evaluates the right mouse button you can still\n"
"get the right mouse button pop-up menu while pressing the Shift key?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat wanneer 'n program evalueer die regterkant muis knoppie jy kan "
"nogsteeds \n"
"kry die regterkant muis knoppie pop-up kieslys terwyl gedruk die "
"Verskuiwende sleutel?\n"

#: tips.cpp:111
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that when a program evaluates the left mouse button you can still "
"select\n"
"text while pressing the Shift key?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat wanneer 'n program evalueer die links muis knoppie jy kan "
"nogsteeds kies \n"
"teks terwyl gedruk die Verskuiwende sleutel?\n"

#: tips.cpp:116
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can let Konsole set the current directory as the window "
"title?\n"
"For Bash, put 'export PS1=$PS1\"\\[\\e]0;\\H:\\w\\a\\]\"' in your ~/.bashrc "
".\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan laat Konsole stel die huidige gids as die venster titel?\n"
"Vir Bash, plaas 'export Ps1=$Ps1\"\\[\\e]0;\\H:\\w'n\\]\"' in jou ~/.bashrc "
".\n"

#: tips.cpp:121
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can let Konsole set the current directory as the session "
"name?\n"
"For Bash, put 'export PS1=$PS1\"\\[\\e]30;\\H:\\w\\a\\]\"' in your ~/.bashrc "
".\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat jy kan laat Konsole stel die huidige gids as die venster titel?\n"
"Vir Bash, plaas 'export Ps1=$Ps1\"\\[\\e]0;\\H:\\w'n\\]\"' in jou ~/.bashrc "
".\n"

#: tips.cpp:126
msgid ""
"<p>...that if you let your shell pass the current directory to Konsole "
"within the prompt\n"
"variable, e.g. for Bash with 'export PS1=$PS1\"\\[\\e]31;\\w\\a\\]\"' in "
"your ~/.bashrc, then\n"
"Konsole can bookmark it, and session management will remember your current "
"working directory\n"
"on non-Linux systems too?\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:133
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that double-clicking will select a whole word?\n"
"<p>When you don't release the mouse button after the second click you\n"
"can extend your selection by additional words when moving the mouse.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat double-clicking sal kies 'n volledige woord?\n"
"<p>Wanneer jy moet nie vrylaat die muis knoppie na die tweede kliek jy \n"
"kan uitbrei jou keuse deur aditionele woorde Wanneer beweeg die muis.\n"

#: tips.cpp:139
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that triple-clicking will select a whole line?\n"
"<p>When you don't release the mouse button after the third click you\n"
"can extend your selection by additional lines when moving the mouse.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...wat triple-clicking sal kies 'n volledige lyn?\n"
"<p>Wanneer jy moet nie vrylaat die muis knoppie na die derde kliek jy \n"
"kan uitbrei jou keuse deur aditionele lyne Wanneer beweeg die muis.\n"

#: tips.cpp:145
msgid ""
"<p>...that if you drag &amp; drop a URL into a Konsole window you are "
"presented with a\n"
"menu giving the option to copy or move the specified file into the current "
"working directory,\n"
"as well as just pasting the URL as text.\n"
"<p>This works with any type of URL which KDE supports.\n"
msgstr ""

